; Ontology v2: Autonomous Pesticide Spraying Drone -- Energy Budget Domain (evolved)
; Extends domain.ont with Definition 7 Conditions I, II, III from the paper.
;
; This file models battery degradation after 200 charge cycles, as discussed
; in Section IV of the paper. It is the exact ontology evolution example from
; the paper used to validate Theorem 1 (preservation of semantic alignment).
;
; Changes relative to domain.ont:
;   Condition I  (vocabulary extension):
;     Add sort Motor and fun rpm : Motor -> Real
;     Source: electric motor telemetry vocabulary (EASA 2019/947 Annex)
;     These additions do not affect any existing interpretation formulas.
;
;   Condition II (axiom strengthening -- battery degradation):
;     Tighten battery_capacity from 500 to 450 (battery degradation after 200 cycles)
;     Source: Section IV of the paper (exact example)
;     The axiom total_upper: total_consumption <= battery_capacity
;     now gives total_consumption <= 450 (was <= 500).
;     Any context with total_consumption = 460 was valid under domain.ont
;     but is correctly REJECTED under domain_v2.ont. (Verified in RUN 4.)
;
;   Condition III (derived/consistent interpretation update -- see pt_v2.interp):
;     shutoff! updated to (and (<= total_consumption 450) (covered 1))
;     power_down! updated to (and (>= (- 450 total_consumption) 0) (covered 1))
;     These are semantically equivalent to the symbolic forms under domain_v2.ont
;     (battery_capacity = 450), demonstrating that Theorem 1 holds.
;
; All original sorts, functions, relations, and non-strengthened axioms are preserved.

; === SORTS === (all original sorts from domain.ont)
sort Hectare      ; unit of land area -- discrete field zones
sort Real         ; real-valued energy consumption
sort Nat          ; natural-valued indices

; === CONDITION I: new sort and function (vocabulary extension) ===
; Source: EASA 2019/947 Annex I (electric motor operational parameters)
sort Motor        ; electric motor identifier (DJI Agras T30 has 6 rotors)
fun rpm           : Motor -> Real  ; revolutions per minute for motor m

; === FUNCTIONS === (all from domain.ont, unchanged)
fun consumption      : Hectare -> Real
fun num_hectares     : Nat
fun total_consumption: Real
fun battery_capacity : Real

; === RELATIONS === (all from domain.ont, unchanged)
rel covered          : Hectare

; === AXIOMS ===
; Unchanged axioms from domain.ont:
axiom num_h         : (= num_hectares 10)
axiom nn_consumption: (>= (consumption 1) 0)
axiom cons_upper    : (<= (consumption 1) 50)
axiom cons_upper_2  : (<= (consumption 2) 50)
axiom cons_upper_3  : (<= (consumption 3) 50)
axiom cons_upper_4  : (<= (consumption 4) 50)
axiom cons_upper_5  : (<= (consumption 5) 50)
axiom total_nn      : (>= total_consumption 0)

; === CONDITION II: strengthened axiom -- battery degradation ===
; battery_capacity tightened from 500 to 450 (200 charge cycles: 10% degradation)
; Source: Section IV of the paper (canonical example for Theorem 1)
axiom bat_cap_v2    : (= battery_capacity 450)

; total_upper re-stated with new battery_capacity bound (entailed by bat_cap_v2 + total_upper_sym):
axiom total_upper   : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity)

; Extended axioms (unchanged from domain.ont):
fun max_per_hectare_dose : Real
axiom max_dose_val  : (= max_per_hectare_dose 50)

fun buffer_zone_width : Real
axiom buffer_val    : (= buffer_zone_width 5)

fun min_coverage_per_hectare : Real
axiom min_coverage  : (= min_coverage_per_hectare 40)

fun battery_reserve : Real
axiom bat_reserve   : (= battery_reserve 50)

fun max_flight_time : Real
axiom max_flight    : (= max_flight_time 300)

; RPM non-negativity (well-formedness for new Motor sort)
axiom rpm_nn        : (>= (rpm 1) 0)
